# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NITO SPORTS — .gitignore
#
# The project itself has no dependencies and no build step, so this file is
# short on purpose. Everything listed here is either a secret, personal data,
# or throwaway test output.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- secrets & personal data -----------------------------------------------
# tools/server.js creates this on its first run. It holds the scrypt hash of
# the staff password AND every customer enquiry (names, e-mail addresses,
# phone numbers). Committing it would publish the owner's credentials and his
# customers' data, so it must never enter the repository.
data/

# --- throwaway test output --------------------------------------------------
# Written by run-tests.sh when a suite fails, and by the screenshot helpers.
tests/test-logs/

# --- local tool metadata ----------------------------------------------------
# Written by the desktop helper that launches the project. Machine-specific,
# carries nothing the repository needs.
*.genie

# --- OS noise ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- dependencies -----------------------------------------------------------
# Not used by the site. Listed so a stray `npm install` cannot be committed.
node_modules/
